Thus we need to treat origin_availability_alpha and destination_availability_alpha as candidates that need to be prepared etc.

We have init: we have origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha, destination_availability_node_linked destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha. Also candidate_origin_availability_linked shift_candidate_alpha origin_availability_alpha etc.

We need to lock origin_availability and destination_availability, load payload, assemble transport leg, etc.

