Thus we need to dispatch each of the four.

We need to allocate vehicles and dispatch slots for each. We have three vehicle_units (alpha, beta, gamma) and one dispatch_slot_alpha. Only one dispatch slot? Actually we have only dispatch_slot_alpha. But we need to dispatch four entities, each requires a dispatch slot. However after dispatching, the action execute_*_dispatch makes vehicle_available and dispatch_slot_available again (adds them). So the dispatch slot is released after dispatch, allowing reuse. Similarly vehicle becomes available after dispatch. So we can reuse same vehicle and slot for multiple dispatches sequentially.

