Now we need to make each candidate dispatch_ready.

For origin_availability_alpha and destination_availability_alpha: dispatch_ready via mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready or mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready. Preconditions: origin_availability_locked, origin_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_loading_authorized.

