Attach task profile: but RTP is currently linked to OA (we attached earlier). We need to detach before reusing for DA. So we need detach_task_profile OA RTP after we are done with OA's task profile link (maybe after lock? Actually we still need OA's task profile link for later steps: authorize transport leg loading requires origin_availability has task profile linked. So we need OA to retain task profile link until after authorize loading. Similarly DA needs its task profile link for authorize loading? The authorize_transport_leg_loading requires origin_availability_task_profile_linked (origin_availability). It does not require destination's task profile. So only origin needs task profile link for loading authorization. Destination does not need it for that step. However mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready does not require task profile. So destination may not need task profile link after lock? But allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate requires candidate_task_profile_linked for each candidate, so destination will need its own task profile link for dispatch allocation. So we need to attach task profile to destination as well, but we can detach after allocation.

