Now we need to verify that all preconditions hold at each step given the state changes.

Let's double-check some steps for potential missing preconditions.

Step1: create_candidate OA: precondition not candidate_created OA and not dispatched OA. Initially false, ok.

Step2: allocate_vehicle_unit OA VA: precondition candidate_created OA (true after step1), not vehicle_allocated OA (true), vehicle_available VA (true). Effect: vehicle_allocated OA, candidate_vehicle_linked OA VA, not vehicle_available VA.

Step3: attach_task_profile OA RTP: precondition candidate_created OA (true), vehicle_allocated OA (true), route_task_profile_available RTP (true). Effect: candidate_task_profile_linked OA RTP, not route_task_profile_available RTP.

Step4: confirm_candidate_preparedness OA RTP: precondition candidate_created OA, vehicle_allocated OA, candidate_task_profile_linked OA RTP, not candidate_prepared OA. All true. Effect: candidate_prepared OA.

Step5: assign_operator_resource OA OP: precondition candidate_prepared OA (true), operator_available OP (true). Effect: candidate_operator_linked OA OP, not operator_available OP.

Step6: activate_origin_node OA ON RTP: precondition candidate_prepared OA (true), candidate_task_profile_linked OA RTP (true), origin_availability_node_linked OA ON (true from init), not origin_node_ready ON (true), not origin_node_occupied ON (true). Effect: origin_node_ready ON.

Step7: detach_task_profile OA RTP: precondition candidate_task_profile_linked OA RTP (true). Effect: route_task_profile_available RTP, not candidate_task_profile_linked OA RTP.

Step8: lock_origin_availability OA ON OP: precondition candidate_prepared OA (true), candidate_operator_linked OA OP (true from step5), origin_availability_node_linked OA ON (true), origin_node_ready ON (true from step6), not origin_availability_locked OA (true). Effect: origin_availability_locked OA, origin_availability_confirmed OA.

Step9: release_operator_resource OA OP: precondition candidate_operator_linked OA OP (true). Effect: operator_available OP, not candidate_operator_linked OA OA? Actually not candidate_operator_linked OA OP.

Now OA state: candidate_created, vehicle_allocated, candidate_prepared true, candidate_operator_linked false, origin_availability_locked true, origin_availability_confirmed true, origin_node_ready true, transport leg not yet assembled.

Step10: create_candidate DA: precondition not candidate_created DA, not dispatched DA. Initially false. Effect: candidate_created DA.

Step11: allocate_vehicle_unit DA VB: precondition candidate_created DA (true), not vehicle_allocated DA (true), vehicle_available VB (true). Effect: vehicle_allocated DA, candidate_vehicle_linked DA VB, not vehicle_available VB.

Step12: attach_task_profile DA RTP: precondition candidate_created DA (true), vehicle_allocated DA (true), route_task_profile_available RTP (true after step7). Effect: candidate_task_profile_linked DA RTP, not route_task_profile_available RTP.

Step13: confirm_candidate_preparedness DA RTP: precondition candidate_created DA, vehicle_allocated DA, candidate_task_profile_linked DA RTP, not candidate_prepared DA. Effect: candidate_prepared DA.

Step14: assign_operator_resource DA OP: precondition candidate_prepared DA (true), operator_available OP (true after step9). Effect: candidate_operator_linked DA OP, not operator_available OP.

Step15: activate_destination_node DA DN RTP: precondition candidate_prepared DA (true), candidate_task_profile_linked DA RTP (true), destination_availability_node_linked DA DN (true), not destination_node_ready DN (true), not destination_node_occupied DN (true). Effect: destination_node_ready DN.

Step16: detach_task_profile DA RTP: precondition candidate_task_profile_linked DA RTP (true). Effect: route_task_profile_available RTP, not candidate_task_profile_linked DA RTP.

Step17: lock_destination_availability DA DN OP: precondition candidate_prepared DA (true), candidate_operator_linked DA OP (true), destination_availability_node_linked DA DN (true), destination_node_ready DN (true), not destination_availability_locked DA (true). Effect: destination_availability_locked DA, destination_availability_confirmed DA.

Step18: release_operator_resource DA OP: precondition candidate_operator_linked DA OP (true). Effect: operator_available OP, not candidate_operator_linked DA OP.

Now OA and DA both locked/confirmed, nodes ready, vehicles allocated (OA-VA, DA-VB), operator free.

Step19: assemble_transport_leg OA DA ON DN TL: precondition:
- origin_availability_locked OA (true)
- destination_availability_locked DA (true)
- origin_availability_node_linked OA ON (true)
- destination_availability_node_linked DA DN (true)
- origin_node_ready ON (true)
- destination_node_ready DN (true)
- origin_availability_confirmed OA (true)
- destination_availability_confirmed DA (true)
- transport_leg_available TL (true)
Effect: transport_leg_assembled TL, transport_leg_origin_linked TL ON, transport_leg_destination_linked TL DN, not transport_leg_available TL.

Step20: attach_task_profile OA RTP: precondition candidate_created OA (true), vehicle_allocated OA (still true), route_task_profile_available RTP (true after step16). Effect: candidate_task